#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""ptop -- PosterChan top. A cyberpunk system monitor for PosterChan servers and PosterChanOS.

Every CPU core, memory, per-interface network bandwidth, iostat-style disk I/O (IOPS, throughput, await latency,
utilisation per disk) and the busiest processes, under the PosterChan logo. Python 3 standard library only: it reads
/proc and /sys directly, so it runs on any PosterChan node without installing anything.

    ptop                 interactive (q quit, / search by name/command/PID, c/m/p/n sort, +/- refresh interval)
    ptop --once          one frame to stdout and exit (scripts, screenshots)
    ptop --json          one measured snapshot as JSON (what the screen is drawn from)
    ptop --ascii         no Unicode graphics; --colors 256 for terminals without truecolor
"""
